{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2njp4kjm","type":"work","title":"茶董","authors":[{"name":"夏樹芳","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9befi"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《茶董》•二卷","author_info":"明夏樹芳撰","summary":"明夏樹芳撰。樹芳字茂卿，江陰人。是編雜錄南北朝至宋、金茶事，不及采造煎試之法，但摭詩句啟實，然疏漏特甚，舛誤亦多。其曰《茶董》者，以《世說記》干寶為鬼之董狐，襲其文也。前有陳繼儒序，卷首又題繼儒補，其氣類如是，則其書不足詰矣。","edition":"浙江汪啟淑家藏本"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《茶董》二卷","author_info":"明夏樹芳輯","summary":"《茶董》二卷。明夏樹芳輯。中國科學院圖書館藏明刻本。","edition":"中國科學院圖書館藏明刻本","volume":"第79冊","section":"子部"}],"juan_count":{"number":2},"resources":[{"id":"wikisource","name":"维基文库","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/茶董","types":["text"]},{"id":"shidianguji-baolibahekeben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/SDZJ0035","metadata":{"edition":"宝历八年和刻本","version":"v3","total_page":118,"paragraph_count":226,"has_translation":true,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-mingkeben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/NGJ8921285208444","metadata":{"edition":"明刻本","version":"v3","total_page":268,"paragraph_count":849,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-keben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02055894","metadata":{"edition":"刻本","version":"v3","total_page":107,"paragraph_count":336,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NCL-06880_%E8%8C%B6%E8%91%A3.pdf"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":2}],"measure_info":"二卷","books":["988g5zf5l5"],"updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:41:40+00:00","_has_text":true,"_has_image":true,"period":"ming","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「明」","dynasty":"明","dynasty_basis":"author_propagation","ai_note":"[ming-round1: author.dynasty 集合=['明'] → dynasty=明]\n\n2026-08-24 J11 description 撮自本條所繫之著錄：本欄之文由撰人、卷數、著錄諸志、志按所稱之佚文出處與輯家、存佚五節綴成，**每節皆據本條 indexed_by 之引文，不出其外，亦不臆造**。凡